{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY &amp; FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Medium-length visual novel with multiple heroines</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lush artwork, detailed event scenes, and 2D anime-style sprites </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vignette-style slice-of-life focused on cozy college friendships</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully voiced by a veteran cast of professional Japanese VAs </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It all started with a mobile game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just random, anonymous bro-chats online.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing serious\u2014just dumb jokes and girl trouble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like my hopeless crush on the older hottie on campus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What\u2019s the harm, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s not like we\u2019d ever meet in real life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Except the next day...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cWHAAAAAAAAAAAT?!\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cYOU\u2019RE ALL GIIIIIIIIIRLS?!\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And not just any girls\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They\u2019re my age, go to my college... and live in my building?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As in, right next door, this entire time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That\u2019s how the summer I\u2019ll never forget all began.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHARACTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743790/extras/12666b4d016a590ec5ba4423479ca3ac.avif?t=1756959089\" width=616 height=231 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Momoka Taguchi</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Ari Kitano</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Part of your all-male-turned-female chat group.<br>A year older than you, she\u2019s upbeat, active and easy to talk to...<br>Works part-time at the caf\u00e9 on the first floor of your building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743790/extras/3cc266aff58eaabe09e17391eb196e73.avif?t=1756959089\" width=616 height=231 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Akari Mizushima</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Misuzu Fuurin</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The older girl you\u2019ve been crushing on who\u2019s also one year older.<br>Happens to be best friends with Aoi, so you see her around a lot...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743790/extras/3492e682171ac06b4c49a652cb49e004.avif?t=1756959089\" width=616 height=231 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hiyori Kojima</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Nana Hiiragi</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of your online \u201cbros.\u201d<br>Carefree and bubbly, she never seems to act her age.<br>Her airheaded ways tend to land you in constant trouble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743790/extras/d929f5f3b75bd138f7f781f063435310.avif?t=1756959089\" width=616 height=231 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aoi Hayasaka</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hanami Takanashi</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Another of your online \u201cbros.\u201d<br>Blunt, casual, and clueless about how she screws with your head.<br>Like with Hiyori, it\u2019s been becoming kind of a problem...</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/ima